<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kurikulum Koding & Kecerdasan Artifisial - Kemendikdasmen</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS untuk styling modern yang cepat -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans antialiased">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 text-white p-2 rounded-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900">Kemendikdasmen</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Koding & Kecerdasan Artifisial</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://kurikulum.kemendikdasmen.go.id/koding-ka" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
               class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition duration-200 flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span>Situs Resmi</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt text-xs"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900 to-blue-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <span class="bg-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-200 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 inline-block">
                Inisiatif Kurikulum Baru
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">
                Mempersiapkan Generasi Unggul Lewat Koding & AI
            </h2>
            <p class="text-indigo-100 text-base md:text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Informasi dan panduan resmi mengenai integrasi mata pelajaran Koding dan Kecerdasan Artifisial dalam sistem pendidikan dasar dan menengah di Indonesia.
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
                <a href="#info-utama" class="bg-white text-indigo-900 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg shadow hover:bg-indigo-50 transition">
                    Pelajari Selengkapnya
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main id="info-utama" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            
            <!-- Kolom Kiri/Utama: Ringkasan Info -->
            <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-indigo-600"></i>
                        <span>Tentang Program Koding & KA</span>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Program ini dirancang untuk menjawab tantangan era digital global, di mana kemampuan pemecahan masalah (problem solving), logika komputasi, serta pemahaman dasar mengenai kecerdasan artifisial menjadi fondasi penting bagi siswa sejak dini.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        Melalui laman resmi Kemendikdasmen, pendidik, orang tua, dan siswa dapat mengakses dokumen panduan, capaian pembelajaran, serta modul pelatihan terkait kurikulum ini.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Bagian Preview/Embed Alternatif (Fallback jika situs mengizinkan iframe) -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-desktop text-indigo-600"></i>
                        <span>Akses Halaman Langsung</span>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-sm">
                        Jika Anda ingin melihat tampilan interaktif langsung di situs sumber, silakan klik tombol di bawah ini untuk membuka tautan resminya di tab baru.
                    </p>
                    <div class="p-6 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl text-center border border-dashed border-slate-300">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-globe text-4xl text-indigo-500 mb-3"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-1">kurikulum.kemendikdasmen.go.id/koding-ka</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Buka halaman resmi Kementerian Pendidikan Dasar dan Menengah.</p>
                        <a href="https://kurikulum.kemendikdasmen.go.id/koding-ka" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                           class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-medium px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition">
                            Kunjungi Situs Sekarang <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Kolom Kanan: Sidebar Navigasi Cepat -->
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">Poin Penting</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
                        <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>Pengenalan Algoritma & Logika Dasar</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>Literasi Kecerdasan Artifisial (AI)</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>Penerapan Etika Digital & Keamanan</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>Panduan Guru & Modul Ajar</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-indigo-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-2">Butuh Bantuan?</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-indigo-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Kunjungi portal utama Kurikulum Kemendikdasmen untuk informasi pembaruan kebijakan pendidikan lainnya.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://kurikulum.kemendikdasmen.go.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                       class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 flex items-center space-x-1">
                        <span>Portal Utama Kurikulum</span>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[10px]"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 mt-12 py-6">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
            <p>&copy; 2026 - Halaman Informasi Kurikulum Koding & KA. Referensi dari <a href="https://kurikulum.kemendikdasmen.go.id/koding-ka" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Kemendikdasmen</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
